\title{State variables and phase space}
\date{2026-11-25}

\p{The words membrane potential and ionic current are assumed. A voltage
recording reports one number at each time. Two situations that share
that number can still differ in another coordinate, so the recording
alone does not name the situation.}

\p{What data send the present situation to a later one?}

